@*
    The house mark for the navbar: the full cut, untiled, inlined, at 32px.

    Inlined rather than <img>, because that is the only way it can take its colour from the link
    around it. currentColor resolves against .navbar-brand's --bs-navbar-brand-color, so the mark
    follows the wordmark for free - the deeper blue in light mode, the lifted #75b9e6 in dark, and
    the hover colour on hover. An <img> sits at one fixed blue and is wrong in half of those.

    32px rather than 24, and that is a stroke-weight decision rather than a taste one. This cut is
    stroke-width 4 on a 96 viewBox, so it draws a 1.0px line at 24 and 1.33px at 32; the mark's own
    commit puts its legibility floor at "about 24px". At 24 the two overlapping spool discs close up
    into one shape. The simplified cut (homespool-icon.svg, stroke-width 11) was tried here for
    exactly that reason and rejected: it survives small sizes by dropping the house to a bare
    chevron, which is legibility bought with the idea. 32 keeps the whole drawing.

    It costs a few pixels of navbar height, since 32 exceeds the wordmark's line box.

    Geometry is homespool-mark-mono.svg verbatim, minus two things: its color="#278ED3" presentation
    attribute, which exists so an <img> of that file renders blue and which would defeat the
    inheritance this partial is for; and its role="img"/aria-label, because the link's own text
    already reads "Homespool" and labelling the mark too makes a screen reader say it twice.

    The mask ids are document-global once inlined. One instance per page today; render this twice on
    one page and they collide and need suffixing.
*@
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 96 96" width="32" height="32"
     fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="me-2 flex-shrink-0">
  <defs>
    <mask id="hs-full-behind-spool">
      <rect width="96" height="96" fill="#fff"/>
      <g fill="#000" stroke="#000" stroke-width="9" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <ellipse cx="40.5" cy="52.45" rx="23" ry="29"/>
        <ellipse cx="55.5" cy="55.55" rx="23" ry="29"/>
      </g>
    </mask>
    <mask id="hs-full-behind-near">
      <rect width="96" height="96" fill="#fff"/>
      <ellipse cx="55.5" cy="55.55" rx="23" ry="29" fill="#000"/>
    </mask>
  </defs>
  <path d="M48 6 86 28V74H10V28Z" stroke-width="4" stroke-linejoin="round" mask="url(#hs-full-behind-spool)"/>
  <ellipse cx="40.5" cy="52.45" rx="23" ry="29" stroke-width="4" mask="url(#hs-full-behind-near)"/>
  <ellipse cx="55.5" cy="55.55" rx="23" ry="29" stroke-width="4"/>
  <ellipse cx="55.5" cy="55.55" rx="6.5" ry="8.2" stroke-width="4"/>
</svg>
